  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/0/01/Friends_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20160312124226\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Friends bar icon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Friends bar icon\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/0/01/Friends_Icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/100?cb=20160312124226\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Friends bar icon</figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Friends</b> are other players (and <a href=\"/wiki/greg-7538\" title=\"Greg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Greg</a>) that the player has added as friends. They are displayed in the friends tab.\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/28/Friend_Book.png/revision/latest?cb=20171022142001\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Friend book\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Friend book\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/28/Friend_Book.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/100?cb=20171022142001\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Friend book</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Players can access their friends tab by opening their <b>friends bar</b>. They can manage their friends list through the <a href=\"/wiki/friend-book-26387\" title=\"Friend Book\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">friend book</a>.\n</p><p>Although the player can also add their <a href=\"/wiki/neighborhood-10438\" title=\"Neighborhood\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">neighbors</a> as friends, the two are seen as distinct in the game (and therefore show up on two different tabs in the friends bar).\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Adding friends through the game</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/65/Follow_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20171229103207\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Follow icon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Follow icon\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/65/Follow_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20171229103207\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Follow icon</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Players can <b>add friends</b> in different ways:\n</p>\n<ul><li>They can follow up to 10 farms by tapping on the bookmark icon when visiting them. This adds these players' farms to their friends tab and to the 'following' list in their <a href=\"/wiki/friend-book-26387\" title=\"Friend Book\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">friend book</a>.</li>\n<li>They can request other players to become their friends by tapping on the plus icon when visiting them. This sends the player a request, which they can accept or decline.</li>\n<li>They can share their friend tag with other players. The friend tag is found in the <a href=\"/wiki/friend-book-26387\" title=\"Friend Book\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">friend book</a>.</li></ul>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Adding friends through Supercell ID</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"/unavailable-source?title=Special%3AUpload\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:Supercell ID.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\">Supercell ID</span></a><figcaption>Supercell ID</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Fellow players who are <a href=\"/wiki/settings-22791\" title=\"Settings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">have connected their farms to Supercell ID</a> are automatically added to the friends tab of their Supercell ID friends.\n</p><p>Supercell ID friends are listed in the 'friends' tab of the <a href=\"/wiki/friend-book-26387\" title=\"Friend Book\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">friend book</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Adding friends through GameCenter</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/23/Game_Center.png/revision/latest?cb=20140401212719\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"GameCenter\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"GameCenter\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>GameCenter</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Players using certain versions of iOS devices can add friends through their Game Center friends list. They can also share their GameCenter ID with other players. \n</p><p>Game Center friends are listed in the 'friends' tab of the <a href=\"/wiki/friend-book-26387\" title=\"Friend Book\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">friend book</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Benefits from adding friends</b></span></h3>\n<p>As players add Supercell friends, the number of boxes available in their <a href=\"/wiki/roadside-shop-2677\" title=\"Roadside Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">roadside shops</a> increases.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Helping friends</b></span></h3>\n<p>Friends, neighbors and other players who come to a player's farm can:\n</p>\n<ul><li>buy items from their <a href=\"/wiki/roadside-shop-2677\" title=\"Roadside Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">roadside shop</a></li>\n<li>fulfill their <a href=\"/wiki/boat-2675\" title=\"Boat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">boat</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/truck-2673\" title=\"Truck\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">truck</a> orders</li>\n<li>fulfill <a href=\"/wiki/town-visitors-13241\" title=\"Town Visitors\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Town Visitors</a> requests</li>\n<li>revive their <a href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-trees-and-bushes-2601\" title=\"Category:Trees and Bushes\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">trees and bushes</a></li></ul>\n<p>The farm of a player who needs help with boat orders or <a href=\"/wiki/trees-and-bushes-7454\" title=\"Trees and Bushes\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">reviving</a> plants is marked with an exclamation point for other players to see. The exclamation point stays in place above their farm name until all help requests are filled.\n</p><p>It shows up:\n</p>\n<ul><li>in the friends tab</li>\n<li>in the <a href=\"/wiki/daily-dirt-2679\" title=\"Daily Dirt\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Daily Dirt</a></li>\n<li>in the <a href=\"/wiki/neighborhood-10438\" title=\"Neighborhood\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">neighborhood</a> chat window</li></ul>\n<p><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f7/Friends_Bar.png/revision/latest?cb=20150619141659\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Friends needing help\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Friends needing help\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"45\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/a7/Newspaper_Excerpt.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20150619145031\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Newspaper Excerpt\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"110\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/5/54/Farm_Needs_Help.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20150619150429\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Farm Needs Help\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"121\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Benefits from helping other players</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>When fulfilling <a href=\"/wiki/boat-2675\" title=\"Boat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">boat</a> orders player gains <a href=\"/wiki/coin-6079\" title=\"Coin\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">coins</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/leaderboard-19046\" title=\"Leaderboard\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">leaderboard</a> points and <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> points.</li>\n<li>Helping other players awards <a href=\"/wiki/gift-card-16941\" title=\"Gift Card\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">gift cards</a>, which can then be used to buy packages from the <a href=\"/wiki/catalogue-8567\" title=\"Catalogue\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">catalogue</a>.</li>\n<li>Helping other players is a <a href=\"/wiki/derby-18422\" title=\"Derby\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">derby</a> task.&#160;The task includes any help given, such as reviving trees and bushes and filling boat orders.</li>\n<li>Visiting other players' farms increases the chance to get random&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/mystery-box-6452\" title=\"Mystery Box\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">mystery boxes</a>, beyond those that randomly pop up on a player's own farm.</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Strategy tips</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>If you need help, list something for sale in the Roadside Shop and advertise it (leave the green checkmark on).</li>\n<li>If you need more friends, take advantage of the <a href=\"/wiki/daily-dirt-2679\" title=\"Daily Dirt\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Daily Dirt</a>. Every ad in the paper is a quick link to an active farm, so you can visit people's shops and send them friend requests. Random friend requests are often well-received because friendship is mutually beneficial.\n<ul><li>Friending people from the daily dirt also allows you to prioritize by level. Friends at a lower level than you are more likely to create help requests that you can fill. Friends at a higher level than you are more likely to fill your own help requests.</li></ul></li></ul>\n<hr>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260829150519\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.026 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.041 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 122/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 424/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 38/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/200\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    4.209      1 -total\n 38.06%    1.602      1 Template:Languages\n 28.20%    1.187      1 Template:PageDisplay\n 25.68%    1.081      5 Template:Clr\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_hayday:pcache:idhash:7721-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260829150519 and revision id 109056. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>",
